* Mixed devices: mouse to keyboard, then back to mouse.
Goal: Edit and save a document
. Goal: Select text with mouse
.. Look at <text>
.. Point to <text>
.. Click <text>
. Goal: Replace text with keyboard
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <replacement text>
.. Verify <replacement text> is displayed
. Goal: Save document with mouse
.. Hands to mouse
.. Look at <save button>
.. Point to <save button>
.. Click <save button>
.. Verify document is saved
